# Build outputs (mirrors .gitignore, minus etc/{test,prod}/*.properties|*.conf
# — those are gitignored local config inputs, not generated outputs, and the
# build actually needs them). Excluded so stale host build state (e.g.
# dist/msoy-config.xml with host-absolute paths from a local build) doesn't
# get baked into the image and shadow the in-container build.
